{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t凌晨4時24分，中國在海南商業航天發射場使用長征十二號運載火箭，成功將衛星互聯網低軌29組衛星發射升空，衛星順利進入預定軌道，發射任務獲得圓滿成功。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯︰張萬燕\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.488282+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":81,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T00:38:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:16:03.493319+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:41.542284+00:00","content_hash":"0d3417df5d84f98c61d70717f1c4ec6f55a36b106b29ac992440ed58687e697b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}